# Free-standing graphene monolayer (HER tutorial fixture): 2 C atoms,
# primitive hexagonal cell (a = 2.46 Ang), 20 Ang vacuum along c, split
# evenly on both sides (frac z = 0.5) -- deliberately free-standing rather
# than a one-sided slab, so this one structure can also exercise stb-her's
# --both-sides flag (Section 3.3 of the README). Small and fast on purpose:
# every real SIESTA-relaxation step in this walkthrough is FABRICATED
# (Section 6), so this structure only ever needs to be big enough to
# exercise stb-her/stb-herRefs' own file-writing mechanics, never actually
# relaxed for real.
SystemName graphene monolayer (HER tutorial fixture)
SystemLabel siesta

LatticeConstant 1.0 Ang
%block LatticeVectors
  2.4600000000   0.0000000000   0.0000000000
 -1.2300000000   2.1304224390   0.0000000000
  0.0000000000   0.0000000000  20.0000000000
%endblock LatticeVectors

NumberOfSpecies 1
%block ChemicalSpeciesLabel
 1   6   C
%endblock ChemicalSpeciesLabel

NumberOfAtoms 2
AtomicCoordinatesFormat Fractional
%block AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
 0.000000000   0.000000000   0.500000000   1
 0.333333333   0.666666667   0.500000000   1
%endblock AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
